# W7 item 3 — what tools_package.py produces. Build outputs, not source: an APK
# and a 138 MB Electron bundle regenerated from dist/ by one command, which is
# exactly the sort of thing dist/index.html itself is (and dist/ IS committed,
# because that one file is the product and has to be servable from Pages).
# These are not servable and are not small.
#
# The scratch space is NOT here: it lives outside the repo, at
# %LOCALAPPDATA%/oela-build, because unpacking Electron inside a OneDrive
# folder made OneDrive fight Gradle for file handles. build-tmp/ stays listed
# only so an older checkout, or an OELA_BUILD_TMP pointed back in here, cannot
# accidentally commit 300 MB.
release/
build-tmp/

# Source texture packs (Poly Haven .blend + 4K PBR maps). ~187 MB, and git
# history cannot be trimmed afterwards — for a product whose whole build output
# is under a megabyte, that is a permanent tax for files the app never loads.
# Only the derived, downscaled diffuse map ships; keep the packs locally.
*.blend.zip
